  {"i":"1nu90g6","o":"<div class=\"cs-li cs-bul\" style=\"margin-left:32px\">","h":"<span class=\"cs-fact-tag\">[사례: 기자에게 허위 제보]</span>","k":"1aud6r1"},
  {"i":"1cj55fo","o":"<div class=\"cs-li cs-bul\" style=\"margin-left:48px\">","h":"(1) <span class=\"cs-fact-tag\">[기자]</span> ①비방목적 없어 <span class=\"cs-blue\"><span class=\"cs-u\">§309</span></span> 출판물 명예훼손죄 불성립","k":"k9cyco"},
  {"i":"y45qbe","o":"<div class=\"cs-li cs-bul\" style=\"margin-left:64px\">","h":"②허위 인식 없어 <span class=\"cs-blue\"><span class=\"cs-u\">§15</span>①</span>에 따라 <span class=\"cs-blue\"><span class=\"cs-u\">§307</span>②</span>이 아닌 <span class=\"cs-blue\"><span class=\"cs-u\">§307</span>①</span> 적용","k":"1ok3p9x"},
  {"i":"58ihrv","o":"<div class=\"cs-li cs-bul\" style=\"margin-left:64px\">","h":"③<span class=\"cs-blue\"><span class=\"cs-u\">§307</span>①</span> 명예훼손죄는 <span class=\"cs-blue\"><span class=\"cs-u\">§310</span></span> 진실성 착오 학설·판례에 따라 위법성 조각 가능","k":"stlrwe"},
  {"i":"14diiwh","o":"<div class=\"cs-li cs-bul\" style=\"margin-left:48px\">","h":"(2) <span class=\"cs-fact-tag\">[제보자]</span> ①기자에게 직접 기사재료 제공 → 공연성(전파가능성) 인정되면 <span class=\"cs-blue\"><span class=\"cs-u\">§307</span>②</span> 명예훼손죄 성립","k":"4wgehc"},
  {"i":"19tygn5","o":"<div class=\"cs-li cs-bul\" style=\"margin-left:64px\">","h":"②판례에 따라 <span class=\"cs-blue\"><span class=\"cs-u\">§309</span>②</span> 출판물 명예훼손죄의 간접정범 성립","k":"15dluo1"},
